WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,940 --> 00:00:03,340
The school has taken care of it

2
00:00:03,340 --> 00:00:04,940
Chen Yundong's home is right here.

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:06,940
I think you two, mother and daughter, are pitiful

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,920
Consider me a philanthropist

5
00:00:08,920 --> 00:00:11,410
Don't talk nonsense to me today

6
00:00:11,410 --> 00:00:12,810
Get out if you don't have money

7
00:00:12,810 --> 00:00:15,560
If you are someone looking for trouble

8
00:00:15,560 --> 00:00:19,500
Can't be knocked off

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:20,700
Please ask this sister

10
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:22,100
What happened to the house below?

11
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,100
you call me

12
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,100
Who are you

13
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:25,900
That girl down there owes rent

14
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,300
How many days have I seen each other?

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,300
Do you think it's easy for me?

16
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,490
I can't do it in vain.

17
00:00:30,490 --> 00:00:31,690
The rent her family owes

18
00:00:31,690 --> 00:00:32,890
I'll pay for her first

19
00:00:32,890 --> 00:00:36,340
If you can't pay it next month

20
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:40,260
Still have to move

21
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,460
I'm here to collect the rent.

22
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:02,380
Mr. Chen won't invite me in to sit down.

23
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:08,390
See you at home, please come in

24
00:01:08,390 --> 00:01:10,230
Very good

25
00:01:10,230 --> 00:01:14,590
When I was young, the place I lived in was not as good as my brother here.

26
00:01:14,590 --> 00:01:15,790
Go outside for a while first

27
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:16,790
Brother, let’s talk about something.

28
00:01:16,790 --> 00:01:19,280
Then I'll go up first

29
00:01:24,500 --> 00:01:26,700
Please go up with Ms. Chen and pay attention to your safety.

30
00:01:26,700 --> 00:01:27,700
Okay Mr. Zhang
